  m_text: '- When partial or as a full stack, Fire and Ice Wild land on reels 1 and
    5 respectively, they nudge and Mystery Re-Spin is triggered.

    - Both Wilds become locked and 5 re-spins are awarded.

    - Any Hidden Symbol appeared on reels becomes locked until the end of Mystery
    Re-Spin.'
